"You cannot confirm the inventory adjustment,\n"
"                    the following products have exceeded the discrepancy "
"threshold.\n"
"                    Only users with permissions to apply them can proceed."
msgstr ""
"Popravka zaloge ni mogoče potrditi,\n"
"                    saj so naslednji izdelki presegli prag odstopanja.\n"
"                   Samo uporabniki z ustreznimi pooblastili lahko "
"nadaljujejo."

